<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Ahmedabad To Pune Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I book movers and packers Ahmedabad to Pune for a residential shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Booking is simple: contact Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers via phone, email, or the online portal, share your moving date, inventory details, and pickup address in Ahmedabad. Our team will generate an instant quote, confirm availability, and schedule a pre‑move survey if needed, ensuring a smooth Ahmedabad‑to‑Pune relocation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for a move from Ahmedabad to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the dedicated container trucks cover the 674 km corridor in approximately 12‑14 hours. Factors such as peak holiday traffic, weather, or checkpoint delays can add a few hours, but our real‑time GPS tracking keeps you updated throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my belongings’ value fully covered during the Ahmedabad‑to‑Pune move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All shipments are covered by a 100% insured, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy. You can declare the exact value of high‑worth items, and in the unlikely event of loss or damage, the claim is settled up to the declared amount without any hidden deductions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity move from Ahmedabad to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, GST registration (if applicable), the e‑Way bill for goods in transit, and a signed packing list. For corporate relocations, additional clearance letters from the employer may be required. Our logistics team assists in preparing all paperwork.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any items that cannot be transported on the Ahmedabad‑to‑Pune route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We restrict hazardous materials such as flammable liquids, explosives, and chemicals. Perishable food items, live animals, and extremely high‑value jewelry are also discouraged unless special arrangements are made. Our packing experts will advise you on any restricted items during the survey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does GPS live tracking improve the safety of my shipment between Ahmedabad and Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each container truck is equipped with satellite GPS that streams real‑time location data to our control center and your mobile app. This visibility allows you to monitor progress, receive alerts for any unscheduled stops, and ensures accountability, giving you confidence throughout the Ahmedabad‑to‑Pune transit.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
